description.narrative:
Key interventions objectives are: 

- to contribute to strengthening an Efficient national anti-corruption policy by development and advocacy of normative legal acts, while ensuring public monitoring and expert assessment; fostering transparent and accountable local self-government;

- nurturing an increase in the level of transparency in Ukraine's 100 largest cities, as well as advocating legislative changes to increase transparency and accountability of local self-government bodies and contributing to transparent and accountable recovery of Ukraine.
